<!DOCTYPE html>  
<html lang="th">  
<head>  
<meta charset="UTF-8" />  
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />  
<title>ADHD Smart Screen (SNAP-IV)</title>  

<!-- Favicon & Theme Color Settings -->
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="16x16" href="/favicons/favicon-16x16.png">
<meta name="msapplication-TileColor" content="#ffffff">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#ffffff">

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Sarabun:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">   
<!-- Font Awesome สำหรับไอคอน -->  
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">  
<style>  
  /* Modern CSS Variable & Global Styles */  
  :root {  
    --primary: #1e88e5;  
    --primary-dark: #1565c0;  
    --primary-light: #e3f2fd;  
    --text-main: #2c3e50;  
    --text-muted: #7f8c8d;  
    --bg-body: #f4f7f9;  
    --card-bg: #ffffff;  
    --shadow-soft: 0 15px 35px rgba(21, 101, 192, 0.08);  
    --shadow-card: 0 8px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);  
    --transition-bounce: cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275);  
    
    /* Section & Rating Colors */  
    --inattention-color: #ff4a5a;  
    --hyperactivity-color: #29b6f6;  
    --oppositional-color: #ff9800;  
    --success-color: #2e7d32;  
    --danger-color: #c62828;  
    
    --lvl-0: #2e7d32; /* ไม่เลย - เขียว */
    --lvl-1: #f59f00; /* เล็กน้อย - ส้มเหลือง */
    --lvl-2: #e65100; /* ค่อนข้างมาก - แสด */
    --lvl-3: #c62828; /* มาก - แดง */
  }

body {
  font-family: 'Sarabun', sans-serif;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 30px 15px;
  background-color: var(--bg-body);
  color: var(--text-main);
  line-height: 1.6;
}

.container {
  max-width: 850px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  background-color: var(--card-bg);
  padding: 40px;
  border-radius: 24px;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
  border: 1px solid rgba(21, 101, 192, 0.08);
  transform: translateY(0);
  transition: transform 0.3s ease;
}

/* Header Section Styling */
.header-brand {
  text-align: center;
  margin-bottom: 40px;
}

.brand-icon {
  font-size: 45px;
  color: var(--primary);
  background: var(--primary-light);
  width: 100px;
  height: 100px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  border-radius: 50px;
  margin: 0 auto 15px auto;
  box-shadow: inset 0 0 10px rgba(30, 136, 229, 0.1);
  animation: pulse 2s infinite ease-in-out;
}

@keyframes pulse {
  0% { transform: scale(1); }
  50% { transform: scale(1.05); }
  100% { transform: scale(1); }
}

h1 {
  color: var(--primary-dark);
  margin: 0 0 5px 0;
  font-size: 32px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: -0.5px;
}

.subtitle {
  color: var(--text-muted);
  font-size: 16px;
  margin: 0;
  font-weight: 500;
}

h2 {
  color: var(--text-main);
  font-size: 20px;
  margin-bottom: 25px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
}

h3 {
  color: var(--primary-dark);
  margin: 0 0 20px 0;
  padding: 14px 20px;
  background-color: var(--primary-light);
  border-radius: 14px;
  font-size: 18px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
}

/* Form Layout and Inputs */
.info-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  gap: 20px;
  margin-bottom: 30px;
  background: #f8fafc;
  padding: 25px;
  border-radius: 18px;
  border: 1px solid #edf2f7;
}
.info-group {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}
label {
  margin-bottom: 8px;
  font-weight: 600;
  font-size: 15px;
  color: #4a5568;
}
input[type="text"], input[type="date"], select {
  width: 100%;
  padding: 12px 16px;
  border: 1.5px solid #e2e8f0;
  border-radius: 12px;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  font-size: 15px;
  font-family: 'Sarabun', sans-serif;
  background-color: #fff;
  color: var(--text-main);
  transition: all 0.3s var(--transition-bounce);
}
input[type="text"]:focus, input[type="date"]:focus, select:focus {
  border-color: var(--primary);
  outline: none;
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(30, 136, 229, 0.15);
  transform: translateY(-1px);
}

/* Modern Assessor Radios */
.assessor-options {
  display: flex;
  gap: 15px;
  margin-top: 5px;
}
.assessor-box {
  flex: 1;
  position: relative;
}
.assessor-box input[type="radio"] {
  position: absolute;
  opacity: 0;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  cursor: pointer;
  z-index: 2;
}
.assessor-box label {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 10px;
  padding: 12px;
  background: #ffffff;
  border: 1.5px solid #e2e8f0;
  border-radius: 12px;
  text-align: center;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: all 0.25s var(--transition-bounce);
  font-weight: 500;
  margin: 0;
}
.assessor-box input[type="radio"]:checked + label {
  background-color: var(--primary-light);
  border-color: var(--primary);
  color: var(--primary-dark);
  font-weight: 600;
  transform: scale(1.03);
  box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(30, 136, 229, 0.1);
}

/* Instruction Banner */
.instruction-banner {
  font-weight: 500;
  margin: 35px 0;
  padding: 18px 25px;
  background-color: #fff9db;
  border-left: 5px solid #fcc419;
  border-radius: 0 14px 14px 0;
  font-size: 15px;
  color: #665200;
  display: flex;
  gap: 15px;
  align-items: flex-start;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(252, 196, 25, 0.05);
}
.instruction-banner i.banner-icon {
  font-size: 20px;
  color: #f59f00;
  margin-top: 2px;
}
.instruction-legend {
  margin-top: 8px;
  display: flex;
  gap: 15px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  font-weight: 600;
}
.instruction-legend span {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 5px;
}

/* Question Groups */
.question-group {
  padding: 10px 0;
  margin-bottom: 35px;
  border-radius: 16px;
  background-color: #ffffff;
}

.question {
  margin-bottom: 0;
  padding: 22px 0;
  background-color: transparent;
  border: none;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #edf2f7;
  transition: all 0.25s ease;
}
.question:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
.question > label {
  display: block;
  font-size: 16px;
  font-weight: 600;
  margin-bottom: 15px;
  color: var(--text-main);
}

/* Modern Answer Radio Segment Custom UI with Icons */
.options-inline {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
  gap: 10px;
  margin-top: 12px;
}
.options-inline input[type="radio"] {
  position: absolute;
  opacity: 0;
}
.options-inline label {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  padding: 10px 4px;
  border: 1.5px solid #e2e8f0;
  border-radius: 14px;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: all 0.25s var(--transition-bounce);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 13px;
  background-color: #ffffff;
  color: #4a5568;
  margin: 0;
  text-align: center;
  gap: 4px;
}
.options-inline label i {
  font-size: 22px;
  margin-bottom: 2px;
  transition: transform 0.2s ease;
}

/* Default Color Icon Style on Hover */
.options-inline label[for$="_0"] i { color: var(--lvl-0); }
.options-inline label[for$="_1"] i { color: var(--lvl-1); }
.options-inline label[for$="_2"] i { color: var(--lvl-2); }
.options-inline label[for$="_3"] i { color: var(--lvl-3); }

.options-inline label:hover {
  background-color: #f8fafc;
  border-color: #cbd5e1;
  transform: translateY(-2px);
}
.options-inline label:hover i {
  transform: scale(1.15);
}

/* Selected Radio Styling */
.options-inline input[type="radio"]:checked + label {
  color: white;
  box-shadow: 0 6px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
  font-weight: 600;
  transform: translateY(-3px) scale(1.02);
}
.options-inline input[type="radio"]:checked + label i {
  color: white !important;
  transform: scale(1.1);
}

.options-inline input[type="radio"][value="0"]:checked + label {
  background-color: var(--lvl-0);
  border-color: #1b5e20;
  box-shadow: 0 6px 15px rgba(46, 125, 50, 0.3);
}
.options-inline input[type="radio"][value="1"]:checked + label {
  background-color: var(--lvl-1);
  border-color: #e67e22;
  box-shadow: 0 6px 15px rgba(245, 159, 0, 0.3);
}
.options-inline input[type="radio"][value="2"]:checked + label {
  background-color: var(--lvl-2);
  border-color: #d35400;
  box-shadow: 0 6px 15px rgba(230, 81, 0, 0.3);
}
.options-inline input[type="radio"][value="3"]:checked + label {
  background-color: var(--lvl-3);
  border-color: #b71c1c;
  box-shadow: 0 6px 15px rgba(198, 40, 40, 0.3);
}

/* Modern Action Buttons Container */
.form-buttons {
  display: flex;
  gap: 15px;
  margin-top: 40px;
  justify-content: center;
}
.form-buttons button {
  padding: 14px 28px;
  color: white;
  border: none;
  border-radius: 14px;
  cursor: pointer;
  font-size: 16px;
  font-weight: 600;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
  transition: all 0.25s var(--transition-bounce);
  box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
}

#calculateButton { background-color: var(--primary); width: 50%; justify-content: center; }
#calculateButton:hover { background-color: var(--primary-dark); transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(30, 136, 229, 0.4); }

#printButton { background-color: #475569; }
#printButton:hover { background-color: #334155; transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: 0 8px 15px rgba(71, 85, 105, 0.3); }

#resetButton { background-color: #ef4444; }
#resetButton:hover { background-color: #dc2626; transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: 0 8px 15px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.3); }

/* Result Modern Dashboard Display */
#printResult {
  margin-top: 40px;
  border: 2px solid var(--primary-light);
  padding: 35px;
  border-radius: 22px;
  background-color: #ffffff;
  display: none;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
  animation: fadeInBounce 0.5s var(--transition-bounce);
}
@keyframes fadeInBounce {
  from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px); }
  to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
}

.result-header {
  border-bottom: 2px solid var(--primary-light);
  padding-bottom: 15px;
  margin-bottom: 25px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
  color: var(--primary-dark);
}
.result-header h2 { margin: 0; }

.patient-info-summary {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  gap: 12px 30px;
  background: #f8fafc;
  padding: 20px;
  border-radius: 14px;
  margin-bottom: 30px;
  font-size: 15px;
  border: 1px solid #edf2f7;
}

#displaySummary {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 12px;
  margin-bottom: 30px;
}
#displaySummary p {
  font-size: 16px;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 16px 20px;
  border-left: 5px solid var(--primary);
  background-color: var(--primary-light);
  border-radius: 6px 14px 14px 6px;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);
  transition: transform 0.2s ease;
}
#displaySummary p:hover {
  transform: translateX(4px);
}

.status-badge {
  padding: 6px 16px;
  border-radius: 20px;
  font-weight: bold;
  font-size: 14px;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 6px;
  box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
}
.risk-badge { background-color: #fee2e2; color: var(--danger-color); animation: shake 0.5s ease; }
.normal-badge { background-color: #dcfce7; color: var(--success-color); }

@keyframes shake {
  0%, 100% { transform: translateX(0); }
  25% { transform: translateX(-4px); }
  75% { transform: translateX(4px); }
}

.risk { color: var(--danger-color); font-weight: bold; }
.normal { color: var(--success-color); font-weight: bold; }

/* Modern Result Table */
#printTable { display: none; }
.result-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 20px; border-radius: 14px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: var(--shadow-card); }
.result-table th, .result-table td { padding: 14px 18px; text-align: left; font-size: 15px; }
.result-table th { background-color: var(--primary-dark); color: white; font-weight: 600; }
.result-table td { background-color: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; color: #334155; }
.result-table tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }

.result-table .valid-result td:last-child { color: var(--success-color); font-weight: bold; }
.result-table .invalid-result td:last-child { color: var(--danger-color); font-weight: bold; }

/* Print Media Layout Query styling */
@media print {
  body { background-color: white; padding: 0; margin: 1cm; }
  .container { box-shadow: none; padding: 0; border: none; }
  #snapForm, #calculateButton, #resetButton, #printButton { display: none; }
  #printResult { border: none; padding: 0; display: block !important; }
  #displaySummary { display: none; }
  #printTable { display: block; }
  .result-table { border: 2px solid #333; box-shadow: none; }
  .result-table th, .result-table td { border-color: #333; border-style: solid; }
  h1, h2, h3, h4, p { color: #000 !important; }
  .risk { color: #d32f2f !important; -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact; print-color-adjust: exact; }
  .normal { color: #388e3c !important; -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact; print-color-adjust: exact; }
  .result-table .valid-result td:last-child { color: #388e3c !important; -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact; print-color-adjust: exact; }
  .result-table .invalid-result td:last-child { color: #d32f2f !important; -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact; print-color-adjust: exact; }
}

/* Responsive Design */
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .container { padding: 25px 15px; }
  .info-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding: 15px; }
  .options-inline { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 8px; }
  .form-buttons { flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
  .form-buttons button { width: 100% !important; justify-content: center; }
  .patient-info-summary { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 10px; }
  #displaySummary p { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 5px; }
}
</style>

</head>  
<body>  
  <div class="container" id="mainContainer">    
    <div class="header-brand">  
      <div class="brand-icon">  
        <i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass-chart"></i>  
      </div>  
      <h1>ADHD Smart Screen</h1>  
      <p class="subtitle">แบบประเมินสมาธิสั้น (SNAP-IV) - โรงพยาบาลดอนจาน</p>  
    </div>  
    
    <form id="snapForm">    
      <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-id-card-clip"></i> ข้อมูลพื้นฐานของผู้รับบริการ</h2>    
      <div class="info-grid">  
        <div class="info-group">  
          <label for="name">ชื่อผู้รับบริการ:</label>  
          <input type="text" id="name" placeholder="ระบุชื่อ-นามสกุล" required />  
        </div>  
        
        <div class="info-group">  
          <label for="date">วันที่ประเมิน:</label>  
          <input type="date" id="date" required />  
        </div>  
  
        <div class="info-group">  
          <label for="educationLevel">ระดับการศึกษา:</label>  
          <select id="educationLevel" required>  
            <option value="" disabled selected>--- เลือกระดับการศึกษา ---</option>  
            <option value="ป.1">ประถมศึกษาปีที่ 1</option>  
            <option value="ป.2">ประถมศึกษาปีที่ 2</option>  
            <option value="ป.3">ประถมศึกษาปีที่ 3</option>  
            <option value="ป.4">ประถมศึกษาปีที่ 4</option>  
            <option value="ป.5">ประถมศึกษาปีที่ 5</option>  
            <option value="ป.6">ประถมศึกษาปีที่ 6</option>  
            <option value="มัธยมต้น">มัธยมศึกษาตอนต้น</option>  
            <option value="มัธยมปลาย">มัธยมศึกษาตอนปลาย</option>  
            <option value="อื่นๆ">อื่นๆ</option>  
          </select>  
        </div>  

        <div class="info-group">  
          <label>ประเมินโดย:</label>  
          <div class="assessor-options">  
            <div class="assessor-box">  
              <input type="radio" name="assessor" value="ผู้ปกครอง" id="as_parent" required />  
              <label for="as_parent"><i class="fa-solid fa-user-tie"></i> ผู้ปกครอง</label>  
            </div>  
            <div class="assessor-box">  
              <input type="radio" name="assessor" value="ครู" id="as_teacher" />  
              <label for="as_teacher"><i class="fa-solid fa-chalkboard-user"></i> ครู</label>  
            </div>  
          </div>  
        </div>  
      </div>    

      <div class="instruction-banner">  
        <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info banner-icon"></i>  
        <div>  
          <strong>คำแนะนำสำหรับผู้ประเมิน:</strong> โปรดเลือกคลิกเลือกระดับความรุนแรงของอาการในแต่ละข้อตามที่ท่านสังเกตเห็นพฤติกรรมจริงในระยะนี้:  
          <div class="instruction-legend">  
            <span><i class="fa-regular fa-face-smile" style="color:var(--lvl-0)"></i> ไม่เลย (0)</span>  
            <span><i class="fa-regular fa-face-meh" style="color:var(--lvl-1)"></i> เล็กน้อย (1)</span>  
            <span><i class="fa-regular fa-face-frown" style="color:var(--lvl-2)"></i> ค่อนข้างมาก (2)</span>  
            <span><i class="fa-solid fa-face-grimace" style="color:var(--lvl-3)"></i> มาก (3)</span>  
          </div>  
        </div>  
      </div>    

      <!-- ด้านขาดสมาธิ -->    
      <div class="question-group">  
        <h3><i class="fa-solid fa-head-side-virus" style="color:var(--inattention-color);"></i> ด้านขาดสมาธิ (ข้อ 1-9)</h3>  
        
        <div class="question"><label>1. มักไม่ละเอียดรอบคอบหรือสะเพร่าในการทำงานต่าง ๆ เช่น การบ้าน</label>  
          <div class="options-inline">  
            <input type="radio" name="q1" id="q1_0" value="0" required /><label for="q1_0"><i class="fa-regular fa-face-smile"></i>ไม่เลย <span>(0)</span></label>  
            <input type="radio" name="q1" id="q1_1" value="1"/><label for="q1_1"><i class="fa-regular fa-face-meh"></i>เล็กน้อย <span>(1)</span></label>  
            <input type="radio" name="q1" id="q1_2" value="2"/><label for="q1_2"><i class="fa-regular fa-face-frown"></i>ค่อนข้างมาก <span>(2)</span></label>  
            <input type="radio" name="q1" id="q1_3" value="3"/><label for="q1_3"><i class="fa-solid fa-face-grimace"></i>มาก <span>(3)</span></label>  
          </div>  
        </div>  
        
        <div class="question"><label>2. ทำอะไรนาน ๆ ไม่ได้</label>  
          <div class="options-inline">  
            <input type="radio" name="q2" id="q2_0" value="0" required/><label for="q2_0"><i class="fa-regular fa-face-smile"></i>ไม่เลย <span>(0)</span></label>  
            <input type="radio" name="q2" id="q2_1" value="1"/><label for="q2_1"><i class="fa-regular fa-face-meh"></i>เล็กน้อย <span>(1)</span></label>  
            <input type="radio" name="q2" id="q2_2" value="2"/><label for="q2_2"><i class="fa-regular fa-face-frown"></i>ค่อนข้างมาก <span>(2)</span></label>  
            <input type="radio" name="q2" id="q2_3" value="3"/><label for="q2_3"><i class="fa-solid fa-face-grimace"></i>มาก <span>(3)</span></label>  
          </div>  
        </div>  
  
        <div class="question"><label>3. ดูเหมือนไม่ค่อยฟังเวลามีคนพูดด้วย</label>  
